	(text "PCF8563 at I2C 0x51. D5/D6 isolate the non-rechargeable CR2032.\nX1 plus C18 form the 32.768kHz oscillator; verify drift on prototype.\nRemote BME280 provides temperature/humidity/pressure; no local MCP9808."
